{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 42 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the clonazepam tablet shortage on 2023-03-10 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21, spanning 43 months.",
      "cites": ["E11", "D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 72603030802 identifies Rubicon Research Limited (FEI 3008252295) as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1195651 at that plant ended 2023-01-27 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2023-03-14 — 42 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E3", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An earlier FDA inspection 828916 at the same plant in 2013 was also classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Multiple manufacturers — Accord Healthcare, Aurobindo Pharma USA, Cheplapharm Arzneimittel GmbH, Prinston Pharmaceutical, Rubicon Research Private Limited, and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA — are listed on FDA's shortage list with current status.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 246 units with 31 days on hand at current usage.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Per rule, the buyer should check alternate manufacturers A-S Medication Solutions, Advanced Rx Pharmacy of Tennessee, LLC, and Advanced Rx of Tennessee, LLC, which are not on FDA's shortage list today but whose labels name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4", "D5"]
    }
  ]
}
